1
00:00:00,695 --> 00:00:03,535
(Leonard:)...if I wasn't in shock
that Sheldon has girl problems.

2
00:00:04,574 --> 00:00:06,454
Well, Leonard, go ahead and mock.

3
00:00:06,618 --> 00:00:08,118
It's like my daddy always said:

4
00:00:08,328 --> 00:00:12,038
"Shelly, women aren't anything
but flipping pains in the bottom."

5
00:00:14,542 --> 00:00:16,752
(Leonard:)That's what your father used to say?

6
00:00:16,920 --> 00:00:20,920
(Sheldon:)Well, I took out the bad words
and the "yeehaw," but you get the gist.

7
00:00:22,217 --> 00:00:25,757
If you don't wanna go to the party,
just don't go. You're a grown man.

8
00:00:25,929 --> 00:00:29,429
Act like one. Tell Amy you wanna spend
the weekend having a sleepover...

9
00:00:29,599 --> 00:00:31,849
(Howard:)...and playing video games
with your friends.

10
00:00:33,228 --> 00:00:37,438
Yeah, maybe she'll dig it.
Women like a firm hand on the tiller.

11
00:00:37,607 --> 00:00:39,107
l can never find the tiller.

12
00:00:42,237 --> 00:00:44,907
l got a book. It didn't help.

13
00:00:45,782 --> 00:00:48,282
(Sheldon:)Yeah, I always thought
if I were ever enslaved...

14
00:00:48,451 --> 00:00:51,661
(Sheldon:)...it would be by an advanced species
from another planet...

15
00:00:51,871 --> 00:00:54,961
(Sheldon:)...not some hotsy-totsy from Glendale.

16
00:00:55,750 --> 00:01:05,020
l downloaded an app
that might be helpful in this situation.

